  "limitations": [
    "GameScene does not invoke this optional adapter. OfficialV1 remains incomplete and disabled; UI-16 and G0 are not complete.",
    "Bind UseGameUiMiniMap before applying a compatible fixed-size skin or loading settings. Window 166x198; viewport [11,21,150,152]; coordinates [24,177,118,16]; collapse [146,2,20,16]. Compiled geometry is checked against the layout JSON.",
    "Reuse original Panel, Image, map library, marker dictionary and marker controls, ScaleX/Y, panning and CloseButton handler. The added coordinate label is noninteractive. Disable restores captured skin, window size, panel flags/bounds and close button, then recenters on the current native marker.",
    "OnWindowSkinChanged is an empty protected DXWindow hook invoked after generic skin/client/button geometry restoration; only the minimap override reapplies its active fixed layout. Common window, GPU, inventory and belt regressions passed.",
    "Isolated tests invoke the real map-change subscriber with stub metadata; no map-file loading, lighting, audio, live map transition, networking or game login was executed. External replacement/disposal of original controls is unsupported and replacement binding rejects identity mismatches.",
    "GPU evidence uses hardware SlimDX D3D9, native window Draw and synthetic solid-colour Zl images at 1024x768. It checks clipping/order/backdrop and state restoration; final official artwork, live marker appearance, actual input dispatch, performance, settings persistence and A01..A20 acceptance remain unverified.",
    "1024x768 is the user-confirmed logical baseline; archived captures are reused. No further login, screenshots, chat sending or display-setting changes requested. NPC interaction cards and secondary popups retain existing styles."
  ]
